begin chapter
 chapter name=1;Shift - Right Hand Capitals
 picture=none
 durationpercent=101
 extradescr=
 new keys=JKLH
 begin exercise
   type=Shift Key Introduction
   duration=1
    EVENT=MESSAGE;0;Now you'll learn to type capital letters using the Shift key. To capitalize a letter, hold down the Shift key with the opposite hand's pinky finger, then press the letter. Release Shift after typing.;Using the Shift Key;typing.jpg;left
    EVENT=MESSAGE;0;For right-hand letters (J K L H), use your LEFT pinky to hold the left Shift key. Keep the typing finger on its home position until you're ready to strike the key.;Left Shift for Right Hand;hand.jpg;left
    EVENT=KEYINTRO;0;The picture below shows the positions of capital letters J K L H on your keyboard.;JKLH;SHOW;left;0;0;0;0;0;0;0;0;0
