 begin exercise
   type=Right Shift Introduction
   duration=1
    EVENT=MESSAGE;0;For left-hand letters (F D S A G), use your RIGHT pinky to hold the right Shift key. This is the mirror of what you learned in the previous lesson.;Right Shift for Left Hand;typing.jpg;left
    EVENT=MESSAGE;0;Keep your right hand anchored on the home row. Reach your right pinky down to the right Shift key, hold it, then press the left-hand letter. Release Shift immediately after.;Shift Technique;hand.jpg;left
